unim (0.0.1-3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Remove mutual Conflicts between unim-gui-gtk and unim-gui-qt.
    Both packages can now be co-installed for full GTK+Qt IM coverage.
  * Add dbus to Recommends for unim core package.
  * Fix desktop file icon name (unim-hangul -> unim-korean).
  * Remove unnecessary gtk4-query-immodules calls from maintainer scripts.
  * Exclude bundled unim-cli copy from GNOME extension package.
  * Eliminate redundant double-build in make deb target.

 -- from104 <from104@github.com>  Sat, 14 Mar 2026 12:00:00 +0900

