unim (0.0.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Korean Input Method Engine with 2-bul and 3-bul support.
  * GTK3/GTK4 IM modules.
  * Qt5/Qt6 platform input context plugins.
  * XIM and Wayland protocol support.
  * im-config integration.

